# **Gate fixtures are malformed on purpose — formatting them destroys what they pin.**
# `scripts/lib/fixtures/traps.md` carries a two-space-indented `**Status:**` line to prove the
# parser treats an indented field as prose rather than a declaration. Prettier de-indented it at
# commit time, so the fixture kept its heading ("the field indented") and lost its content — it then
# asserted the opposite of its name and would have passed against a broken parser. Nothing ran it
# between the reformat and the next edit, which is how a fixture rots silently.
scripts/lib/fixtures/
